[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/baritone-patrol/README/README.html]EN/English[/url]|[url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/baritone-patrol/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Baritone Patrol[/h1]A client-side Fabric mod that records an ordered route and makes Baritone continuously patrol its waypoints in a loop.
[h2]Commands[/h2][table]
[tbody]
[tr]
[th]Command[/th]
[th]Description[/th]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/patrol add[/b][/td]
[td]Append the player's current block position to the route.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/patrol add <x> <y> <z>[/b][/td]
[td]Append the specified integer coordinates to the route.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/patrol start[/b][/td]
[td]Start patrolling from the first waypoint.[/td]
[td]·[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/patrol stop[/b][/td]
[td]Stop the active patrol. If no patrol is active, other Baritone goals are left untouched.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/patrol clear[/b][/td]
[td]Delete all recorded waypoints for the current world or server.[/td]
[/tr]
[tr]
[td][b]/patrol list[/b][/td]
[td]Display the recorded route in order.[/td]
[/tr]
[/tbody]
[/table]
[h2]Requirements[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.3[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.5+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.160.5+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*][url=https://github.com/cabaletta/baritone]Baritone[/url] (强制要求)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
